    "title": "Native Works Gazelle 270",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>This lures is designed to attract fish when the bite is slow in general.</span><br /><span>Best action: allow the lure to swim on a slower retrieve in order to create a wider S shape to get the best action out of it.</span><br /></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Recommended hooks: BKK GT-Rex 7/0 or BKK Inline 11/0 on the Belly&nbsp; 9/0 on the tail.</span></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length 270 mm</span></p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Gr. 210</span></p></li></ul>",
